"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\"><img alt=\"Boots of Haste\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Haste_d4312e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Royal Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Royal_Helmet_44a9ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Swamplair Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Swamplair_Armor_18bf2a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spellbook of Mind Control\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_of_Mind_Control_15eca0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crown%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Crown Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crown_Armor_3c8c3d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Elves Foreign Quarter 0\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"114\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elves_Foreign_Quarter_0_1f9a93.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.40<br/>December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>There is a part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a> south-west of the depot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a> where a number of elves live. Head South then walk to the entrance. There are normal <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\">Elves</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a> on the first floor. In the buildings you can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a> on the upper floors. It is one of the best places to hunt Elves, since <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a> is often on fire and full of <a href=\"#/wiki/Firestarter\">Firestarters</a> after the implementation of <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Changes</a>. \n</p><p>The deeper parts are also called <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter%2FElves\">Crystal Lakes</a>. You can access them by going down a ladder in the middle of this place (here). Going down you will find one <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanist</a>:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Elves Foreign Quarter 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elves_Foreign_Quarter_1_b91d0d.png\" width=\"106\"/></span><br/>\n</p><p>Going down another level you will find 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a>:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Elves Foreign Quarter 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"98\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elves_Foreign_Quarter_2_dbc692.png\" width=\"110\"/></span><br/>\n</p><p>Now you are in a place with 4 ramps: North, south, east and west. You can take any ramp to get down in an area with ~5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and ~5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Elves Foreign Quarter 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elves_Foreign_Quarter_3_c286ce.png\" width=\"156\"/></span><br/>\n</p><p>You can enter 4 different caves now, some containing only <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, some containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydras</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Spawn\">Serpent Spawns</a> as well.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Elves Foreign Quarter 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elves_Foreign_Quarter_4_f8aef4.png\" width=\"322\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>A: 11 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Spawn\">Serpent Spawn</a></li>\n<li>B: 13 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a></li>\n<li>C: 9 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydra</a></li>\n<li>D: 15 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a></li></ul>\n<p>If you are a medium leveled knight you can hunt the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a> and gain ~65k/hour and good loot. Don't forget to bring your <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> to skin the dragons.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Ground Level</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\"><img alt=\"Elf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elf_3529cf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\">Elf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">42</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">40 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Boots\">Leather Boots</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a></li>\n<li>Plate Shield</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Plum\">Plum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Studded%20Armor\">Studded Armor</a></li>\n<li>Studded Helmet</li>\n<li>Elvish Talisman (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heaven%20Blossom\">Heaven Blossom</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\"><img alt=\"Elf Scout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elf_Scout_23e350.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">75</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">110 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-25× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a></li>\n<li><a h